Re-read the instruction after the JIT's stop_tracing optimizes.

label(stop_tracing) samples the opcode before stop_tracing_and_jit(). The
optimizer can run a finalizer whose ResourceWarning writes
__warningregistry__ into watched globals, invalidating the executor and
clearing its slot; the stale ENTER_EXECUTOR then calls _PyJIT_Entry(NULL).
Reproduced by Mozilla's packager.py --minify (mozjar.py JarStruct genexpr)
in every Firefox/Thunderbird/LibreWolf "mach install".

Upstream: https://github.com/python/cpython/issues/160852
          https://github.com/python/cpython/pull/160853
Closed unmerged on 2026-10-28 (JIT development on hold upstream).

